                "Maharaja Ranjit Singh (1780–1839) of the Sukerchakia Misl founded the unified Sikh Empire, capturing Lahore (1799) and Amritsar (1802); signed the Treaty of Amritsar (1809) with Charles Metcalfe, fixing the Sutlej as the boundary with the British.",
